	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10032"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744" title="View the profile of zigak">zigak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg10032#msg10032"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg10032#msg10032">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #46 on:</b> August 12, 2004, 04:11:20 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Did I miss a post by silverblades the l33t ranj0r?&nbsp; I&#039;m not seeing it anywhere. <br /><br />Just responding to where he was quoted.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">as far as your pulling it stinks pulling 5 6 or 7 mobs and expecting the ranger to root them all is idiotic to begin with and if you cant handle pulling 2 or 3 mobs at a time then perhaps its time for you to start another toon that doesnt have to pull.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;silverblades.</div><br />Lets see, the most in camp ever was 3 and the only reason we had 3 in camp was because your wizard friend wanted to follow me.&nbsp; Most of the time there was only one in camp, I was chain pulling (pulling another one before the first was dead).&nbsp; Your a fucking liar as well as a shitty ranjer.&nbsp; Know your role you ass monkey before you try and tell other people theirs.&nbsp; <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Another thing id like to say id i was parking adds as they came they just kept resisisting and breaking my roots so for those people who werent there need to keep their posts to themselves miss simplee mee. who are u to talk about the situation when you werent even present for it.</div><br />I was there, you were not trying to park shit asshole.&nbsp; Perhaps you were too busy jerking off to visions of my fine bardic ass.<br /><br />You are truely a piece of work silverblades, even your guild leader/officer or whoever the hell he is knows what a raging dipshit you are.&nbsp; He was trying to be nice, but reading between the lines he thinks you are a fucknut too.&nbsp; Why don&#039;t you do RN a favor, delevel to 20 and stay in pauldaul caverns with the rest of the l33t ranj0rz.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
