							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg10471#msg10471"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg10471#msg10471">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #55 on:</b> August 26, 2004, 09:00:30 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think I was in a guild once that had a &quot;NO masterbating/cybering on raids&quot; policy.  I&#039;m not so sure that helped much.  Every once in awhile someone would mistell and make you WISH whatever they said could go back to being a secret.........<br /><img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/wtf.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Don&#039;t we all Hemo....don&#039;t we all. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
